{"segs": ["PA_ja_186:0.1", "PA_ja_186:0.2", "PA_ja_186:0.3"], "en": "Jātaka: The Second Book of Birth Stories (Dukanipāta), Chapter on the Peerless (Asadisavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_186:0.4"], "en": "6. The Jātaka of Dadhivāhana:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_186:1.1", "PA_ja_186:1.2"], "en": "“In former times, this mango tree was endowed with color, fragrance, and flavor.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_186:1.3"], "en": "“Receiving such honor as this,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_186:1.4"], "en": "how could it have such bitter fruit?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_186:2.1"], "en": "“Surrounded by *pucimanda* trees,” [he replied].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_186:2.2"], "en": "Both of you, O Dadhivāhana,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_186:2.3"], "en": "let root be associated with root,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_186:2.4"], "en": "and let branch attend upon branch.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_186:2.5"], "en": "“By dwelling with those who are disagreeable,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_186:2.6"], "en": "such is the bitter fruit thereof.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_186:3.1"], "en": "The *Dadhivāhana Jātaka*, the sixth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
